# Calm Before the Storm (CoP 7-4): the Cryptonberry Assassins' deaths. A level 75 Warrior of San d'Oria with 7-4 current
# (a GM; the CID status nibble 0) at Carpenters' Landing's qm_cryptonberries: the Executor spawned and claimed,
# CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR_POP (7271). A GM spawns two of the three Assassins (CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+1 and +2), which in
# play the Executor's own script calls once the char's first swing raises his enmity (here kill takes him at once, as he
# is the char's already). The Executor killed: CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR_DIE (7496) twice, 7-4's messageText and the mob's
# own script; qm_cryptonberries with the two Assassins (and the Executor's body) up: CRYPTONBERRY_FALLEN_TREE (7270, the
# zone's default). Both killed; two ticks (20 s, then 4 s) let the three bodies despawn (the 038 despawn animations,
# then their 00E updates); a GM spawns the third (+3); qm_cryptonberries with only it up: 7270 again. The third killed;
# qm_cryptonberries with carpentersNm 15 from the four deaths, no GM local var: 37; finished: bit 1 (the nibble 2);
# again: 7270.
lists CarpentersLanding/qm_cryptonberries/onTrigger CarpentersLanding/Cryptonberry_Assassin/onMobDeath CarpentersLanding/onEventFinish/37
char zone=CarpentersLanding pos=117,-5.5,-387 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop CalmBeforeTheStorm current
login
trigger qm_cryptonberries               # the Executor spawned: 7271
spawn CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+1           # a GM
spawn CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+2           # a GM
kill CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR              # 7496 twice
trigger qm_cryptonberries               # two Assassins up: 7270 (the default)
kill CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+1            # the first Assassin
kill CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+2            # the second
tick 20000                              # the three bodies start to despawn
tick 4000                               # their fade ends
spawn CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+3           # a GM
trigger qm_cryptonberries               # only the third up: 7270 (the default)
kill CRYPTONBERRY_EXECUTOR+3            # the third
trigger qm_cryptonberries               # 15 from the four deaths: 37
finish                                  # bit 1
trigger qm_cryptonberries               # bit 1 set: 7270
